file construction/archive/REDS-a-receipt-keyed-on-an-inventory-rows-675.md the peer's shelf, taken whole at the rebase; mine for the same row was dropped
file construction/archive/REDS-the-wall-that-was-a-glob-rows-616.md shelf head written by hand, the row moved by reds_fold.sh
file construction/archive/REDS-fold-recital.md two recital lines, written by the fold tool rather than by me
file construction/ITINERARY.md the INCENSE account replaced; elder shelved whole by tools/i/itinerary_account_shelf.sh
