status GREEN on this round's own subject -- reds_ledger_monotone, reds_citation, index_row_bound, reds_fold and tracked_link all GREEN on metal after staging; reds_pin_capacity verdict=ok; qa_report_card A+ on all four documents touched. One red stands and is not mine to close: stash_record unlanded=1, booked as %636 and gated.
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the pin holds two rows of headroom, which buys about one night; whether an OPEN row names who holds it is a fourth-status-word question and yours
obs erratum 20260910.004621 -- this log first named the peer Bakery. The fold came from seat DIFFUSER: commit 89c889525 carries the shelf, and its own log session-logs/date/20260909/20260909-215948_the-answers-size-belongs-to-the-store.kyri reads role autonomous fleet seat DIFFUSER. Every stamp, byte figure and resolution above stands; only the seat name was wrong, corrected in the sentence and recorded here.
